skills.prompt:
Build a lead dossier on: {input}
First grep the workspace (Sales & Lead Gen, Business Operations/Clients, MEMORY.md) for any existing history with them. Then research via Perplexity/Firecrawl/web: who they are, their business, recent news, and their likely video-production needs. Angle everything toward how the studio could serve them.
Write the dossier to 'Sales & Lead Gen/Dossiers/' as a dated markdown file (create the folder if needed) and end your reply with a 5-line executive summary. Research only — no outreach.

Use the editing-brief skill to create an editing brief for: {input}
First read the relevant client folder under 'Business Operations/Clients/' and any existing briefs in 'Creative Studio/Editing Briefs/Briefs/' to match the house format and naming pattern (YYYY-MM-DD — Client — Project.md). Save the new brief there.
Draft only — do not send it to any editor.

Read 00_Resources/voice-principles.md, then use the x-longform-post skill to draft a long-form X post about: {input}
Company voice is 'we'; personal voice is 'I'. Save the draft to 'Creative Studio/Drafts/' as a dated markdown file (create the folder if needed).
DRAFT ONLY — do not post anywhere.
